# An allowlist, not a denylist. The build context is four entries, so anything
# added to this repository later stays out of the image until somebody says
# otherwise. The same argument as the scan policy, one layer down.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src

# Byte-compiled leftovers from a local run are not part of the source.
src/**/__pycache__
src/**/*.pyc
